@baseUrl = http://localhost:5089/api/partners

### Criar cliente (Name e NIF são normalizados)
# @name createCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": " Ana Silva ",
  "taxNumber": "001.234.567",
  "type": "CUSTOMER",
  "email": "ana.silva@example.com",
  "creditLimit": 1500.50
}

### Mesmo NIF noutro formato -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Silva Duplicada",
  "taxNumber": "001 234 567",
  "type": "SUPPLIER",
  "creditLimit": 0
}

### Dados inválidos -> 400 com todos os erros
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A",
  "taxNumber": "12345678A",
  "type": "OTHER",
  "email": "invalido",
  "creditLimit": 10.999
}

### Obter por Id
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{createCustomer.response.body.$.id}}

### Id inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Id malformado -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/abc

### Listagem por defeito (apenas ativos, página 1, 20 por página)
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Filtros combinados: nome ou NIF + tipo + inativos + paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}?Search=ana&Type=CUSTOMER&IncludeInactive=true&Page=1&PageSize=10

### Pesquisa por NIF com separadores
GET {{baseUrl}}?Search=500.100.200

### Type=SUPPLIER inclui SUPPLIER e BOTH
GET {{baseUrl}}?Type=SUPPLIER

### Página além dos resultados -> Items vazio com TotalCount correto
GET {{baseUrl}}?Page=100&PageSize=5

### Filtros inválidos -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}?Page=0&PageSize=101&Type=customer

### Atualizar (todos os campos são obrigatórios; Email pode ser null)
# @name updateCustomer
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{createCustomer.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Maria Silva",
  "taxNumber": "001-234-567",
  "type": "BOTH",
  "email": null,
  "creditLimit": 2500,
  "isActive": true,
  "version": "{{createCustomer.response.body.$.version}}"
}

### Repetir com a versão antiga -> 409
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{createCustomer.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Maria Silva",
  "taxNumber": "001234567",
  "type": "BOTH",
  "email": null,
  "creditLimit": 2500,
  "isActive": true,
  "version": "{{createCustomer.response.body.$.version}}"
}

### Desativar (usa a versão mais recente)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{createCustomer.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Maria Silva",
  "taxNumber": "001234567",
  "type": "BOTH",
  "email": null,
  "creditLimit": 2500,
  "isActive": false,
  "version": "{{updateCustomer.response.body.$.version}}"
}

### Criar fornecedor
# @name createSupplier
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fornecedor Exemplo",
  "taxNumber": "222-333-444",
  "type": "SUPPLIER",
  "creditLimit": 0
}

### Mudar para o NIF de outra entidade -> 409 (dados mantidos)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{createSupplier.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fornecedor Exemplo",
  "taxNumber": "001.234.567",
  "type": "SUPPLIER",
  "email": null,
  "creditLimit": 0,
  "isActive": true,
  "version": "{{createSupplier.response.body.$.version}}"
}

### Version malformada -> 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{createSupplier.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fornecedor Exemplo",
  "taxNumber": "222333444",
  "type": "SUPPLIER",
  "email": null,
  "creditLimit": 0,
  "isActive": true,
  "version": "abc"
}
